@@ -0,0 +1,166 @@
+/* GIMP - The GNU Image Manipulation Program
+ * Copyright (C) 1995 Spencer Kimball and Peter Mattis
+ *
+ * chopgimp-layer-styles.h
+ * ChopGimp : styles de calque façon Photoshop (Ombre portée, Lueur
+ * externe, Ombre interne, Lueur interne, Contour, Biseau)
+ *
+ * Each layer style is a GIMP filter (GEGL operation) opened in its
+ * filter dialog with starting settings, "operation\n(settings)" as
+ * filters_parse_operation() reads it. The same settings are the
+ * "factory" defaults restored by the dialog's "Rétablir" button. The
+ * user's own defaults ("Définir par défaut") are saved as a preset of the
+ * operation named after the style, see CHOPGIMP_LAYER_STYLE_DEFAULT_NAME.
+ *
